ssed.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>', 'Recombinant Human FGFb (K128N)', 'BQP-0068', 'BQP-0068,Recombinant Human FGFb (K128N)', 'Recombinant Human Thermostable Fibroblast Growth Factor 2 is produced by our E.coli expression system and the target gene encoding Met1-Ser155 is expressed.', '[{\"uid\": 1787215941674, \"url\": \"/upload/1/bioquanti/yangben.webp\", \"name\": \"yangben.webp\", \"path\": \"/upload/1/bioquanti/yangben.webp\", \"status\": \"success\"}]', 'BioQuanti', 'bioquanti', '0', '', 0, '', '2026-08-17 20:52:17', 0, '', 0, '2026-08-21 14:45:46', 0, '57', '2026-08-20 15:52:15', '57', 0);
