 Human IFNGR1 (C-6His)', 'BQP-0092', 'BQP-0092,Recombinant Human IFNGR1 (C-6His)', 'Recombinant Human Interferon Gamma Receptor 1 is produced by our Mammalian expression system and the target gene encoding Glu18-Ser245 is expressed with a 6His tag at the C-terminus.', '[{\"uid\": 1787215941698, \"url\": \"/upload/1/bioquanti/yangben.webp\", \"name\": \"yangben.webp\", \"path\": \"/upload/1/bioquanti/yangben.webp\", \"status\": \"success\"}]', 'BioQuanti', 'bioquanti', '0', '', 0, '', '2026-08-16 20:52:17', 0, '', 0, '2026-08-21 14:45:46', 0, '57', '2026-08-20 15:52:15', '57', 0);
