in solution can be stored at 2-8°C for 2-7 days.<br/>Aliquots of reconstituted samples are stable at ≤ -20°C for 3 months.</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width:160px;background:#f4f8fc;\">产品描述</th><td>Recombinant Human Neuritin is produced by our E.coli expression system and the target gene encoding Ala28-Gly116 is expressed with a 6His tag at the N-terminus.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>', 'Recombinant Human Neuritin (N-6His)', 'BQP-0177', 'BQP-0177,Recombinant Human Neuritin (N-6His)', 'Recombinant Human Neuritin is produced by our E.coli expression system and the target gene encoding Ala28-Gly116 is expressed with a 6His tag at the N-terminus.', '[{\"uid\": 1787215941783, \"url\": \"/upload/1/bioquanti/2.jpg\", \"name\": \"2.jpg\", \"path\": \"/upload/1/bioquanti/2.jpg\", \"status\": \"success\"}]', 'BioQuanti', 'bioquanti', '0', '', 0, '', '2026-08-13 07:52:17', 0, '', 0, '2026-08-21 14:45:46', 0, '57', '2026-08-20 15:52:15', '57', 0);
