le for one year after receipt.<br/>Reconstituted protein solution can be stored at 2-8°C for 2-7 days.<br/>Aliquots of reconstituted samples are stable at ≤ -20°C for 3 months.</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width:160px;background:#f4f8fc;\">产品描述</th><td>Recombinant Human Fibronectin Fragment is produced by our E.coli expression system and the target gene encoding Pro1270-Ser1546&amp;Ala1721-Thr2016 is expressed.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>', 'Recombinant Human NovoNectin', 'BQP-0181', 'BQP-0181,Recombinant Human NovoNectin', 'Recombinant Human Fibronectin Fragment is produced by our E.coli expression system and the target gene encoding Pro1270-Ser1546&Ala1721-Thr2016 is expressed.', '[{\"uid\": 1787215941787, \"url\": \"/upload/1/bioquanti/shengwu_shengchan.webp\", \"name\": \"shengwu_shengchan.webp\", \"path\": \"/upload/1/bioquanti/shengwu_shengchan.webp\", \"status\": \"success\"}]', 'BioQuanti', 'bioquanti', '0', '', 0, '', '2026-08-13 03:52:17', 0, '', 0, '2026-08-21 14:45:46', 0, '57', '2026-08-20 15:52:15', '57', 0);
