ipt.<br/>Reconstituted protein solution can be stored at 2-8°C for 2-7 days.<br/>Aliquots of reconstituted samples are stable at ≤ -20°C for 3 months.</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width:160px;background:#f4f8fc;\">产品描述</th><td>Recombinant Mouse C-C Motif Chemokine 24 is produced by our E.coli expression system and the target gene encoding Val27-Val119 is expressed.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>', 'Recombinant Mouse CCL24', 'BQP-0243', 'BQP-0243,Recombinant Mouse CCL24', 'Recombinant Mouse C-C Motif Chemokine 24 is produced by our E.coli expression system and the target gene encoding Val27-Val119 is expressed.', '[{\"uid\": 1787215941849, \"url\": \"/upload/1/bioquanti/2.jpg\", \"name\": \"2.jpg\", \"path\": \"/upload/1/bioquanti/2.jpg\", \"status\": \"success\"}]', 'BioQuanti', 'bioquanti', '0', '', 0, '', '2026-08-10 13:52:17', 0, '', 0, '2026-08-21 14:45:46', 0, '57', '2026-08-20 15:52:15', '57', 0);
INSERT INTO `cms_content` VALUES ('1787212335907001688', '2787212335907000302', '<div class=\"bq-spec\"><h3>产品参数</h3><table class=\"table table-bordered\" style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;\"><tbody><tr><th style=\"width:160px;background:#f4f8fc;\">货号</th><td>BQP-0244</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width:160px;background:#f4f8fc;\">产品名称</th><td>Recombinant Mouse CCL3 (N-6His)</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width:160px;background:#f4f8fc;\">产品别称</th><td>C-C motif chemokine 3;Heparin-binding chemotaxis protein; Macrophage inflammatory protein 1-alpha;MIP1-a;  chemokine (C-C motif) ligand 3; LD78a; LD78 alpha; MIP-1 alpha;Scya3</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width:160px;background:#f4f8fc;\">规格</th><td>10μg/50μg/500μg/1mg</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width:160px;background:#f4f8fc;\">蛋白编号</th><td>P10855</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width:160px;background:#f4f8fc;\">分子量</th><td>10.8 KDa</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width:160px;background:#f4f8fc;\">表观分子量</th><td>15 KDa, reducing conditions</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width:160px;background:#f4f8fc;\">内毒素</th><td>&lt; 1 EU/µg as determined by LAL test.</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width:160px;background:#f4f8fc;\">纯度(SDS-PAGE)</th><td>Greater than 95% as determined by reducing SDS-PAGE. (QC verified)</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width:160px;background:#f4f8fc;\">剂型描述</th><td>Lyophilized from a 0.2 μm filtered solution of 20mM Tris-HCl, 150mM NaCl, 5%Trehalose, 1mM EDTA, pH 8.0.</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width:160px;background:#f4f8fc;\">复溶说明</th><td>Always centrifuge tubes before opening.Do not mix by vortex or pipetting.<br/>It is not recommended to reconstitute to a concentration less than 100μg/ml.<br/>Dissolve the lyophilized protein in distilled water.<br/>Please aliquot the reconstituted solution to minimize freeze-thaw cycles. </td></tr><tr><th style=\"width:160px;background:#f4f8fc;\">运输条件</th><td>The product is shipped at ambient temperature.<br/>Upon receipt, store it immediately at the temperature listed below.</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width