 Mouse FGF-10', 'BQP-0255', 'BQP-0255,Recombinant Mouse FGF-10', 'Recombinant Mouse Fibroblast growth factor 10 is produced by our E.coli expression system and the target gene encoding Ser62-Thr209 is expressed.', '[{\"uid\": 1787215941861, \"url\": \"/upload/1/bioquanti/2.jpg\", \"name\": \"2.jpg\", \"path\": \"/upload/1/bioquanti/2.jpg\", \"status\": \"success\"}]', 'BioQuanti', 'bioquanti', '0', '', 0, '', '2026-08-10 01:52:17', 0, '', 0, '2026-08-21 14:45:46', 0, '57', '2026-08-20 15:52:15', '57', 0);
