-20°C, stable for one year after receipt.<br/>Reconstituted protein solution can be stored at 2-8°C for 2-7 days.<br/>Aliquots of reconstituted samples are stable at ≤ -20°C for 3 months.</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width:160px;background:#f4f8fc;\">产品描述</th><td>Recombinant Rat Kit Ligand is produced by our Mammalian expression system and the target gene encoding Gln26-Ala189 is expressed with a 6His tag at the C-terminus.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>', 'Recombinant Rat SCF (C-6His)', 'BQP-0341', 'BQP-0341,Recombinant Rat SCF (C-6His)', 'Recombinant Rat Kit Ligand is produced by our Mammalian expression system and the target gene encoding Gln26-Ala189 is expressed with a 6His tag at the C-terminus.', '[{\"uid\": 1787215941947, \"url\": \"/upload/1/bioquanti/yangben.webp\", \"name\": \"yangben.webp\", \"path\": \"/upload/1/bioquanti/yangben.webp\", \"status\": \"success\"}]', 'BioQuanti', 'bioquanti', '0', '', 0, '', '2026-08-06 11:52:17', 0, '', 0, '2026-08-21 14:45:46', 0, '57', '2026-08-20 15:52:15', '57', 0);
