lution can be stored at 2-8°C for 2-7 days.<br/>Aliquots of reconstituted samples are stable at ≤ -20°C for 3 months.</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width:160px;background:#f4f8fc;\">产品描述</th><td>Recombinant Salmonella typhimurium Flagellin is produced by our E.coli expression system and the target gene encoding Met1-Arg495 is expressed.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>', 'Recombinant Salmonella Typhimurium Flagellin', 'BQP-0344', 'BQP-0344,Recombinant Salmonella Typhimurium Flagellin', 'Recombinant Salmonella typhimurium Flagellin is produced by our E.coli expression system and the target gene encoding Met1-Arg495 is expressed.', '[{\"uid\": 1787215941950, \"url\": \"/upload/1/bioquanti/yangben.webp\", \"name\": \"yangben.webp\", \"path\": \"/upload/1/bioquanti/yangben.webp\", \"status\": \"success\"}]', 'BioQuanti', 'bioquanti', '0', '', 0, '', '2026-08-06 08:52:17', 0, '', 0, '2026-08-21 14:45:46', 0, '57', '2026-08-20 15:52:15', '57', 0);
INSERT INTO `cms_content` VALUES ('1787212335907001789', '2787212335907000411', '<div class=\"bq-spec\"><h3>产品参数</h3><table class=\"table table-bordered\" style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;\"><tbody><tr><th style=\"width:160px;background:#f4f8fc;\">货号</th><td>BQAP-0001</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width:160px;background:#f4f8fc;\">名称</th><td>Canine KIM-1 / TIM1 / HAVCR1 ELISA Pair Set</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width:160px;background:#f4f8fc;\">中文名称</th><td>狗 KIM-1 / TIM1 / HAVCR1 酶联免疫配对抗体组合</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width:160px;background:#f4f8fc;\">种属</th><td>Canine</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width:160px;background:#f4f8fc;\">靶分子</th><td>HAVCR1</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width:160px;background:#f4f8fc;\">应用</th><td>ELISA</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width:160px;background:#f4f8fc;\">线性范围</th><td>125-8000</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width:160px;background:#f4f8fc;\">灵敏度</th><td>The minimum detectable dose of Canine KIM-1 / TIM1 / HAVCR1 was determined to be approximately 125 pg/ml. This is defined as at least three times standard deviations above the mean optical density of 10 replicates of the zero standard.</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width:160px;background:#f4f8fc;\">检测限</th><td>125 pg/ml</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width:160px;background:#f4f8fc;\">包被抗体</th><td>1 mg/mL of rabbit anti-Canine TIMD1 monoclonal antibody (in PBS, pH 7.4). Dilute to a working concentration of 2 μg/mL in PBS before coating. </td></tr><tr><th style=\"width:160px;background:#f4f8fc;\">检测抗体</th><td>1 mg/mL rabbit anti-Canine TIMD1 monoclonal antibody conjugated to horseradish-peroxidase (HRP) (in PBS, 50 % glycerol, pH 7.4). Dilute to working concentration of 1 μg/mL in detection antibody dilution buffer before use. </td></tr><tr><th style=\"width:160px;background:#f4f8fc;\">标准品</th><td>Reconstitute with 1 mL detection antibody dilution buffer. After reconstitution, store at -20℃ to -80℃ in a manual defrost freezer. A seven-point standard curve using 2-fold serial dilutions in sample dilution buffer, and a high standard of 8 ng/mL is recommended.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>', '狗 KIM-1 / TIM1 / HAVCR1 酶联免疫配对抗体组合', 'BQAP-0001', 'BQAP-0001,Canine KIM-1 / TIM1 / HAVCR1 ELISA Pair Set,Canine', 'Canine KIM-1 / TIM1 / HAVCR1 ELISA Pair Set', '[{\"uid\": 1787215941951, \"url\": \"/upload/1/bioquanti/2.jpg\", \"name\": \"2.jpg\", \"path\": \"/upload/1/bioquanti/2.jpg\", \"status\": \"success\"}]', 'BioQuanti', 'bioquanti', '0', '', 0, '', '2026-08-20 15:52:17', 19, '', 0, '2026-08-21 14:45:46', 0, '57', '2026-08-20 15:52:15', '57', 0);
INSERT INTO `cms_content` VALUES ('1787212335907001790', '2787212335907000411', '<div class=\"bq-spec\"><h3>产品参数</h3><table class=\"table table-bordered\" style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;\"><tbody><tr><th style=\"width:160px;background:#f4f8fc;\">货号</th><td>BQAP-0002</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width:160px;background:#f4f8fc;\">名称</th><td>Cynomolgus CD200R ELISA Pair Set</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width:160px;background:#f4f8fc;\">中文名称</th><td>食蟹猴 CD200R 酶联免疫配对抗体组合</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width:160px;background:#f4f8fc;\">种属</th><td>Cynomolgus</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width:160px;background:#f4f8fc;\">靶分子</th><td>CD200R1</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width:160px;background:#f4f8fc;\">应用</th><td>ELISA</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width:160px;background:#f4f8fc;\">线性范围</th><td>62.5-4000</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width:160px;background:#f4f8fc;\">灵敏度</th><td>The minimum detectable dose of Cynomolgus CD200R was determined to be approximately 62.5 pg/ml. This is defined as at least three times standard deviations above the mean optical density of 10 replicates of the zero standard.</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width:160px;background:#f4f8fc;\">检测限</th><td>62.5 pg/ml</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width:160px;background:#f4f8fc;\">包被抗体</th><td>0.1 mg/mL of mouse anti-Cynomolgus CD200R monoclonal antibody. Dilute to a working concentration of 2.0 μg/mL in CBS before coating. </td></tr><tr><th style=\"width:160px;background:#f4f8fc;\">检测抗体</th><td>0.5 mg/mL mouse anti-Cynomolgus CD200R monoclonal antibody conjugated to horseradish-peroxidase (HRP). Dilute to working concentration of 1 μg/mL in detection antibody dilution buffer before use. </td></tr><tr><th style=\"width:160px;background:#f4f8fc;\">标准品</th><td>Reconstitute standard powder with 1 mL detection antibody dilution buffer. After reconstitution, store at -20℃ to -80℃ in a manual defrost freezer. A seven-point standard curve using 2-fold serial dilutions in sample dilution buffer, and a high standard of 4000 pg/mL is recommended.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>', '食蟹猴 CD200R 酶联免疫配对抗体组合', 'BQAP-0002', 'BQAP-0002,Cynomolgus CD200R ELISA Pair Set,Cynomolgus', 'Cynomolgus CD200R ELISA Pair Set', '[{\"uid\": 1787215941952, \"url\": \"/upload/1/bioquanti/shengwu_shengchan.webp\", \"name\": \"shengwu_shengchan.webp\", \"path\": \"/upload/1/bioquanti/shengwu_shengchan.webp\", \"status\": \"success\"}]', 'BioQuanti', 'bioquanti', '0', '', 0, '', '2026-08-20 14:52:17', 0, '', 0, '2026-08-21 14:45:46', 0, '57', '2026-08-20 15:52:15', '57', 0);
INSERT INTO `cms_content` VALUES ('1787212335907001791', '2787212335907000411', '<div class=\"bq-spec\"><h3>产品参数</h3><table class=\"table table-bordered\" style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;\"><tbody><tr><th style=\"width:160px;background:#f4f8fc;\">货号</th><td>BQAP-0003</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width:160px;background:#f4f8fc;\">名称</th><td>Cynomolgus p53 / TP53 ELISA Pair Set</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width:160px;background:#f4f8fc;\">中文名称</th><td>食蟹猴 p53 / TP53 酶联免疫配对抗体组合</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width:160px;background:#f4f8fc;\">种属</th><td>Cynomolgus</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width:160px;background:#f4f8fc;\">靶分子</th><td>TP53</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width:160px;background:#f4f8fc;\">应用</th><td>ELISA</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width:160px;background:#f4f8fc;\">线性范围</th><td>156.25-10000</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width:160px;background:#f4f8fc;\">灵敏度</th><td>The minimum detectable dose of Cynomolgus p53 / TP53 was determined to be approximately 156.25 pg/ml. This is defined as at least three times standard deviations above the mean optical density of 10 replicates of the zero standard.</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width:160px;background:#f4f8fc;\">检测限</th><td>156.25 pg/ml</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width:160px;background:#f4f8fc;\">包被抗体</th><td>1 mg/mL of mouse anti-Cynomolgus p53 / TP53 monoclonal antibody (in PBS, pH 7.4). Dilute to a working concentration of 2 μg/mL in PBS before coating. </td></tr><tr><th style=\"width:160px;background:#f4f8fc;\">检测抗体</th><td>0.2 mg/mL of mouse anti-Cynomolgus p53 / TP53 monoclonal antibody conjugated to horseradish-peroxidase (HRP) (in PBS, 50 % HRP-Protector, pH 7.4, store at 4℃). Dilute to working concentration of 1 μg/mL in detection antibody dilution buffer before use. </td></tr><tr><th style=\"width:160px;background:#f4f8fc;\">标准品</th><td>Reconstitute with 1 mL detection antibody dilution buffer. After reconstitution, store at -20℃ to -80℃ in a manual defrost freezer. A seven-point standard curve using 2-fold serial dilutions in sample dilution buffer, and a high standard of 10000 pg/mL is recommended.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>', '食蟹猴 p53 / TP53 酶联免疫配对抗体组合', 'BQAP-0003', 'BQAP-0003,Cynomolgus p53 / TP53 ELISA Pair Set,Cynomolgus', 'Cynomolgus p53 / TP53 ELISA Pair Set', '[{\"uid\": 1787215941953, \"url\": \"/upload/1/bioquanti/yangben.webp\", \"name\": \"yangben.webp\", \"path\": \"/upload/1/bioquanti/yangben.webp\", \"status\": \"success\"}]', 'BioQuanti', 'bioquanti', '0', '', 0, '', '2026-08-20 13:52:17', 0, '', 0, '2026-08-21 14:45:46', 0, '57', '2026-08-20 15:52:15', '57', 0);
