dard of 1.5 ng/mL is recommended.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>', '人 DC-SIGN / CD209 酶联免疫配对抗体组合', 'BQAP-0108', 'BQAP-0108,Human DC-SIGN / CD209 ELISA Pair Set,Human', 'Human DC-SIGN / CD209 ELISA Pair Set', '[{\"uid\": 1787215942058, \"url\": \"/upload/1/bioquanti/yangben.webp\", \"name\": \"yangben.webp\", \"path\": \"/upload/1/bioquanti/yangben.webp\", \"status\": \"success\"}]', 'BioQuanti', 'bioquanti', '0', '', 0, '', '2026-08-16 04:52:17', 0, '', 0, '2026-08-21 14:45:46', 0, '57', '2026-08-20 15:52:15', '57', 0);
