ution buffer, and a high standard of 4 ng/mL is recommended.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>', '人 Granulin / GRN / Progranulin 酶联免疫配对抗体组合', 'BQAP-0143', 'BQAP-0143,Human Granulin / GRN / Progranulin ELISA Pair Set,Human', 'Human Granulin / GRN / Progranulin ELISA Pair Set', '[{\"uid\": 1787215942093, \"url\": \"/upload/1/bioquanti/shengwu_shengchan.webp\", \"name\": \"shengwu_shengchan.webp\", \"path\": \"/upload/1/bioquanti/shengwu_shengchan.webp\", \"status\": \"success\"}]', 'BioQuanti', 'bioquanti', '0', '', 0, '', '2026-08-14 17:52:17', 0, '', 0, '2026-08-21 14:45:46', 0, '57', '2026-08-20 15:52:15', '57', 0);
