on buffer, and a high standard of 350 pg/mL is recommended.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>', '人 IL7/IL-7/Interleukin-7 酶联免疫配对抗体组合', 'BQAP-0193', 'BQAP-0193,Human IL7/IL-7/Interleukin-7 ELISA Pair Set,Human', 'Human IL7/IL-7/Interleukin-7 ELISA Pair Set', '[{\"uid\": 1787215942143, \"url\": \"/upload/1/bioquanti/2.jpg\", \"name\": \"2.jpg\", \"path\": \"/upload/1/bioquanti/2.jpg\", \"status\": \"success\"}]', 'BioQuanti', 'bioquanti', '0', '', 0, '', '2026-08-12 15:52:17', 0, '', 0, '2026-08-21 14:45:46', 0, '57', '2026-08-20 15:52:15', '57', 0);
